nd  joined the empire while jean and shinobu  discover gustav's golden statue in  conrad's castle conrad returns with the  fire mage who shinobu recognizes the  fire mage is revealed to be gustav in  disguise and kills conrad for smashing  his golden statue he then turns his  attention to jean and shinobu attacks  them they escape but not before gustav  destroys the castle killing all the  guards as he marvels at his new powers  gustav suddenly blown up by ringo's  newly built ballistic missile the site  of the blast is seen from dormunt the  next day the prodigies give a speech to  their citizens where tsukasa reveals  that they are now one nation known as  the elm republic and must defend  themselves as a republic not under a  dictatorship while giving the speech a  pillar of fire suddenly appears  revealing gustav who transforms into a  demon and attacks the prodigies  aoe and shinobu attempt to dispatch him  trying to destroy the gem and gustaf's  chest but they're knocked back gustav  leaves towards tsukasa who pulls out a  handgun and destroys the gem as the  demon reaches him as he dies gustav  warns sukkas of the trials ahead of him  and boasts that the prodigies will never  succeed elsewhere a trio from the yamato  empire and general neuro observed the  events in dormant with the latter  proposing that the seven light faith may  be an obstacle for him  so this is it for today's video if you  like the video give it a huge thumbs up  and subscribe to the channel for more  videos farewell till next time
 

